WEBVTT

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:35.780
Hinata!

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.320
Morning!

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.460
Morning.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.980
I brought you a gift from Ikebukuro.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.350
What do you think it is?

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.160
Um...

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.570
Wh-What could it be?

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.420
This! Isn't it cute?

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.760
A horned owl on silver grass!

00:01:58.190 --> 00:01:59.350
Thanks.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:05.520
Isn't it weird how it's a horned owl and 
not an owl, even though it's Ikebukuro?

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.040
Horned owls are owls, too, though.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.270
Are they?

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:16.530
<b>A Clumsy Traversal</b>

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:22.430
<i>I bought one of those, too.</i>

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:23.680
<i>Jeez...</i>

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.570
<i>What am I supposed to do with two?</i>

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:29.950
<i>We keep getting mixed up lately.</i>

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.420
The weather's nice.

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:36.850
Yeah.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.310
Although it's a bit cold.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:40.410
Yeah.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.580
Was the movie any good?

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.650
Y-Yeah.

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.470
My mom liked it, too.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:51.770
Yeah?

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:56.820
There you are!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.820
Aoi-chan! Hinata-chan!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:00.920
Hey!

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.180
Is it okay if we join you?

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.830
You two are free this weekend, right?

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.870
Let's go to the mountains!

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:09.210
That's so spontaneous.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.460
Where to?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.540
Mt. Mizugaki and Mt. Kinpu.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.710
We'll traverse the mountain 
and spend the night in a tent!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:15.970
In a tent?

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:16.960
Traverse?

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.830
It's the end of October.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:22.260
This'll be our last chance to 
climb a tall mountain this year.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.200
You can afford the break from exam prep?

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:24.970
Yeah.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.770
You'll get stressed out if all you do is study.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.590
And I'd feel bad not giving you a reward.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:32.100
Thank you!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.490
Kokona-chan says she can make it, too.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:35.890
You're so quick to get the word out!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.360
Sure, I'll go.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.640
You two can make it, of course, right?

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:39.860
S-Sure.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.290
Could we possibly borrow your 
dad's tents, Hinata-chan?

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:47.560
I only have a one-person tent, 
so we need two two-person tents.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.120
I think it should be okay.

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:51.740
It's settled, then!

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.280
I can't wait!

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:56.000
<i>Kaede-san must have been really stressed out.</i>

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.560
Mt. Mizugaki...

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:07.260
2,230 meters.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:08.560
Mt. Kinpu...

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.430
2,599 meters.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.140
They're pretty tall.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.150
Thanks for helping me.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.370
No problem.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.720
It's fun sleeping over for once.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.160
We're making tomato cream hot pot, right?

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:28.200
Yeah.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.790
Hinata likes it.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:32.810
She's been kind of down lately.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.790
I'm sure she'll love it.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.010
Oh, right! Let's take canned tuna, too.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.200
It's really good when you stew it with the rest.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.790
That sounds good.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:42.800
Let's do that!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.050
That should do it.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.810
Look at the time.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.480
Kokona-chan, I can take care of the rest.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.060
You can go ahead and get some sleep.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.640
I'm still okay.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.590
Just go on.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.740
Goodnight.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:07.980
Now for the main dish.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.900
Do we have anything?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:35.980
Aoi-san!

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.730
Aoi-san, wake up!

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:40.110
Aoi-san! Aoi-san!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.700
Aoi-san!

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.490
Just thirty more minutes...

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.290
We're going to be totally late!

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.480
I'm sorry!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.030
Huh? Kokona-chan?

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.240
We should hurry!

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:00.740
I wonder where they are...

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.610
We're not going to make it.

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.600
Good morning!

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.920
I'm sorry!

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.520
Where were you?

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.790
We can talk later.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:09.800
Hurry!

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.950
Why'd you wait until the last minute?

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.430
What if we'd missed the train?

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:16.970
Sorry.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:18.940
Why were you late, too, Kokona-chan?

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:23.440
We were making meals to have 
on the mountains together.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:24.700
Together?

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.590
Kaede-san did the planning for us,

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.450
and Hinata got us our tents,

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.950
so we wanted to do something, too.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.330
So the two of us...

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.750
That's not a good reason to be late.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.930
Why didn't you go to sleep earlier?

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.250
You did this when we went to Mt. Fuji, too.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:48.260
You have to sleep well and 
be in your best condition!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.620
You know mountain climbing 
isn't easy, don't you?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.920
Okay, that's enough lecturing.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:03.020
Aoi-chan and Kokona-chan 
are sorry, aren't you?

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:03.940
Yes.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.390
Sorry.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:08.380
It's been a while since 
we went mountain climbing.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.910
Let's make it fun.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.880
<b>Chichibu-Tama-Kai National Park
Mizugakisanso</b>

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:33.140
<b>Bus Stop</b>

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.810
First, we'll head to Fujimidaira Cottage.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:33.140
It's about 50 minutes from here.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.870
The air is so nice in the mountains.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.640
It's refreshing!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.760
Please cheer up.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:45.400
We made you your favorite 
tomato cream hot pot.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.160
Fujimidaira

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.160
Mt. Kinpu

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.160
Mt. Fuji 
Viewing Spot

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.160
How is Mt. Fuji today?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.730
Family-Friendly Area

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.300
Looks like Hinata-chan's still angry.

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.660
Jeez.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:18.430
You don't need to get <i>that</i> angry, do you?

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.430
Okay, everyone, are you ready?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.190
We're going to tackle Mt. Mizugaki first.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.560
Off we go!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:34.950
I'd like to get to the top soon, 
but we're sure going downhill a lot.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:37.110
We're going up there, right?

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.170
That's right.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.450
Mt. Mizugaki
1.5 hours

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.540
"Momotaro Boulder," it says.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.040
It does look like a peach.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.400
Is this supposed to be propping it up?

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.430
I wonder if it even works.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:53.450
Right?

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:57.760
Sheesh.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.820
<i>It's a tough climb, but I'm doing okay.</i>

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.050
<i>It must be all the training I've been doing.</i>

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:12.760
Why don't we get Aoi-chan 
to take the lead from here?

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.240
You set the pace for us.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.750
Think about how fast we should go to 
make it easier for the rest of us.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.080
Got it.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:39.200
<i>It's a bit of a detour, but the 
steps are smaller on the right.</i>

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.100
<i>It should be easier to climb.</i>

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.890
This way's shorter.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.460
This way's safer.

00:09:58.560 --> 00:09:59.910
Again!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.620
Jeez!

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.370
Hinata-san?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.650
Oh, it's nothing.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.760
The view's stunning!

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.310
Amazing!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.270
Yum!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.070
Tea is so good on the mountains.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.010
We're climbing Mt. Kinpu over there tomorrow.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:22.620
It looks tough, but I look forward to it.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.220
Shall we head down, then?

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.950
We're going already?

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.140
We have to get back to our 
tents before it gets dark.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.210
Daylight vanishes quickly in the fall.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.160
Hinata-san?

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:37.960
Coming.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.460
<i>It's harder going down.</i>

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:52.300
<i>It's not that bad, though, right?</i>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:59.940
<b>To Be Continued</b>
